# c2: gnss-ins-maritime
seg-43cc6f9c50b2 = gps-sdr-sim holds at most { "3000" } samples, { "300" } s at its fixed { "10" } Hz, and ignores the time column. The <c1/> exports step at exactly { "0.1" } s. Longer scenarios, such as the 20-minute <c2/>, are read to their first { "300" } s only.

