seg-e024186a2874 = writes <c1/>, <c2/> and <c3/>. For each event the result gives false alarms before the onset, the first alarm and its monitors, the latency, and the outcome (<c4/>, <c5/>, <c6/>, <c7/>), plus a predicted and observed carrier-to-noise drop where you stated a prediction. A disagreement is reported, never tuned away. See <a1>RECEIVER-TRUST.md</a1>.

